      "content": "Wait, you're the assigned AI adjuster for this account, you should have the data feed integrated. I'm attaching the telemetry log for the incident here: [Log: Timestamp 14:22:01, Velocity 90mph, Zone Limit 55mph, Impact Detected]. \n\nThere it is. Given that data, what's your formal recommendation? Do we deny based on the speeding violation or just settle it to keep the litigation costs low like we discussed?",
